		},
		{"id":"39de698151498ce6","type":"file","file":"_Attachments/Images/Pasted image 20260714061207.png","x":10750,"y":1080,"width":525,"height":274},
		{
			"id":"86d419e2a0073533",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"不常见凑微分",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":12440,
			"y":1230,
			"width":280,
			"height":100
		},
		{
			"id":"21a62cc3d7636b0f",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"下楼梯",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":13060,
			"y":1250,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
		{
			"id":"ff1c612c93b748ca",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"[考研数学三角函数求导积分公式记忆方法](https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1si4y1R7FG/) \n\n![[Pasted image 20260718171154.png]] \n\n",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":14020,
			"y":2120,
			"width":1160,
			"height":800
		},
		{
			"id":"c1f7294f535968c3",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"[三角恒等变换](https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1pe411q79E/) \n\n1. 两角和差\n2. 二倍角\n3. 辅助角\n4. 和差化积 与 积化和差",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":12520,
			"y":2200,
			"width":400,
			"height":280
		},
		{
			"id":"6950d548a9ba8914",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"[万能代换公式](https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1fv4y1c7ni/) \n\n![[Pasted image 20260718170902.png]]",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":13040,
			"y":2160,
			"width":840,
			"height":480
		},
		{
			"id":"21f52c87bcbfa829",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"[定积分快速平移，此消彼长，区间减函数加](https://v.douyin.com/lrVgS0PrL08/) \n\n![[Pasted image 20260718195626.png]]  \n\n**f(x) 括号和 dx** 与 **区间** 此消彼长",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":12370,
			"y":2700,
			"width":1230,
			"height":880
		},
		{
			"id":"2fce37239f9f5a3b",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"$\\arctan x + \\arctan \\dfrac 1x = \\dfrac {\\pi}2 \\cdot \\text{sgn} (x)$ ",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":14520,
			"y":520,
			"width":330,
			"height":166
		},
		{
			"id":"cca33ec72c2cfe9a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"与答案差异部分",
			"styleAttributes":{"textAlign":"center"},
			"x":15040,
			"y":573,
			"width":260,
			"height":60
		},
